  "title": "Pulled Chicken Sloppy Joes (Sloppy Chickens)",
  "description": "Chef John's Sloppy Chickens are a cross between pulled pork sandwiches and the classic, cafeteria-favorite Sloppy Joes, except they're way easier and take almost no effort.",
